1
00:00:46,738 --> 00:00:52,071
=The Outlaw=

2
00:00:52,096 --> 00:00:54,053
(This story is entirely fictional.)

3
00:00:54,053 --> 00:00:55,873
(All settings are imaginary.)

4
00:00:55,898 --> 00:00:58,905
=Episode 24=

5
00:01:20,079 --> 00:01:20,599
Don't move!

6
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,480
Mian.

7
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,879
At last.

8
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:31,560
Turn around.

9
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:34,760
Turn around.

10
00:01:35,560 --> 00:01:36,719
Turn around or I'll shoot.

11
00:01:51,239 --> 00:01:51,760
Dad.

12
00:02:00,439 --> 00:02:01,400
I never thought

13
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,439
you really were Mian.

14
00:02:05,439 --> 00:02:07,040
I had my suspicions before,

15
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:12,439
but I never thought
you really were Mian.

16
00:02:13,639 --> 00:02:13,960
This...

17
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:17,599
This is the outcome I feared most.

18
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,199
If I could make a choice,

19
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:34,960
I'd want nothing more

20
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:36,599
than for you to go your whole life

21
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:39,199
without ever knowing the truth,

22
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:42,719
instead of ending up like your mom.

23
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,039
You killed Mom!

24
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,439
Mona!

25
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:49,039
What are you trying to do?

26
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:50,199
I'm...

27
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:51,919
I'm your dad.

28
00:02:52,400 --> 00:02:54,280
When you killed Mom...

29
00:02:55,479 --> 00:02:57,479
did you ever stop to think
she was your wife?

30
00:02:57,960 --> 00:02:58,479
Mona.

31
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:58,840
Stop!

32
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,319
You look more like her

33
00:03:02,840 --> 00:03:04,479
every day.

34
00:03:05,439 --> 00:03:07,120
Even your personality's the same.

35
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,680
You just have to go against me!

36
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,280
Dad!

37
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,520
All these years...

38
00:03:13,879 --> 00:03:16,680
I've always seen you as
my role model and idol.

39
00:03:17,639 --> 00:03:18,960
You kept saying you loved her,

40
00:03:20,599 --> 00:03:23,319
but to cover up your dirty deeds,

41
00:03:23,319 --> 00:03:24,599
you killed her with your own hands.

42
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,560
Have you no humanity?

43
00:03:29,599 --> 00:03:30,360
Mona.

44
00:03:31,919 --> 00:03:33,719
I really did love her.

45
00:03:35,439 --> 00:03:37,199
I had no choice.

46
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,639
In this world,

47
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:40,680
good people

48
00:03:41,039 --> 00:03:42,360
don't get ahead.

49
00:03:42,840 --> 00:03:45,240
Only those at the top

50
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:46,159
of the food chain

51
00:03:46,319 --> 00:03:48,240
get to control their own fate.

52
00:03:49,879 --> 00:03:50,439
Dad

53
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:53,240
did it

54
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,599
with your future in mind.

55
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,000
I don't want a future like that.

56
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,639
Especially not one

57
00:04:00,319 --> 00:04:02,599
paid for with Mom's life.

58
00:04:04,319 --> 00:04:04,840
Dad.

59
00:04:06,120 --> 00:04:07,000
Stop this.

60
00:04:08,319 --> 00:04:08,560
You...

61
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,560
Turn yourself in while you still can.

62
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,159
Turn myself in?

63
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,159
And then

64
00:04:16,319 --> 00:04:17,079
let

65
00:04:18,079 --> 00:04:19,720
all my years of work,

66
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:21,480
and

67
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:22,959
the path I paved for you,

68
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,360
go to waste?

69
00:04:26,920 --> 00:04:27,720
Mona.

70
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:31,000
You've really disappointed me.

71
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:32,839
Put the gun down!

72
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:34,639
Mona.

73
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,399
This is

74
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,279
my last warning.

75
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:40,839
Put the gun down.

76
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:42,920
Come back with me,

77
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,360
and you're still my daughter.

78
00:04:46,439 --> 00:04:47,920
But if you insist
on being like your mother,

79
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,519
and standing in my way

80
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,560
with that ridiculous naivety
and sense of justice,

81
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,480
then I'll have no choice

82
00:04:56,160 --> 00:04:56,959
but to send you

83
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:59,040
to join her!

84
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:02,680
Once I, Mokun, set my mind on something,

85
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,879
no one can stop me.

86
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,720
Not

87
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,720
even you.

88
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:09,759
Stop!

89
00:05:11,759 --> 00:05:12,079
You...

90
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:14,160
You're

91
00:05:14,160 --> 00:05:14,879
alive?

92
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:16,240
Ren...

93
00:05:16,959 --> 00:05:18,240
betrayed me after all.

94
00:05:22,240 --> 00:05:23,279
(This bullet nearly killed me)

95
00:05:25,160 --> 00:05:26,240
(back then.)

96
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:29,439
(I've kept it all these years.)

97
00:05:30,399 --> 00:05:31,639
(Today, it finally came in handy.)

98
00:05:34,199 --> 00:05:35,519
(Mian will come for the key today.)

99
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:37,040
(If you don't die,)

100
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,519
(Mian won't show himself.)

101
00:05:47,199 --> 00:05:48,680
He just got his conscience back.

102
00:05:49,879 --> 00:05:50,480
Give it up,

103
00:05:51,439 --> 00:05:51,920
Mokun!

104
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:53,240
Conscience?

105
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,600
A conscience

106
00:05:55,360 --> 00:05:56,800
will only get him killed.

107
00:05:57,319 --> 00:05:58,000
Zhou Yan.

108
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:01,040
You never fail to surprise me.

109
00:06:02,079 --> 00:06:02,639
Before,

110
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:04,560
I used you

111
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:07,279
to take out those three underlings
who were getting out of line,

112
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,120
and take back their businesses.

113
00:06:10,199 --> 00:06:10,839
Then I'd send you

114
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,279
to your death as Mian,

115
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:14,800
and I could step forward

116
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:17,560
as Langia's hero.

117
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,879
But now,

118
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,480
I've changed my mind.

119
00:06:22,639 --> 00:06:23,160
Why don't we

120
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:25,240
put our differences behind us

121
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,480
and rule

122
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,439
Langia together?

123
00:06:30,439 --> 00:06:31,879
What makes you think I'd agree?

124
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:33,120
Because

125
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:35,480
we're the same kind of person.

126
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,800
I'm nothing like you.

127
00:06:38,156 --> 00:06:38,916
Hmph.

128
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,800
Not like me?

129
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,480
Look at the path you've taken.

130
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,399
For revenge,

131
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:46,600
you could

132
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:48,120
pretend to be someone else.

133
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:49,079
You could

134
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,240
stop at nothing.

135
00:06:51,000 --> 00:06:52,160
You could manipulate people.

136
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:54,399
You could use anything

137
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:56,319
at your disposal
without a second thought.

138
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:58,360
That kind of resolve,

139
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,199
that ruthlessness...

140
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:01,839
You're

141
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,360
exactly like I was back then.

142
00:07:04,026 --> 00:07:04,479
I...

143
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:07,360
used to be a good police.

144
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:09,600
I bled.

145
00:07:10,519 --> 00:07:11,160
I risked my life.

146
00:07:11,839 --> 00:07:13,759
I saved a little girl
caught in a war zone.

147
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:15,079
That girl

148
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,639
was Layla.

149
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:17,920
And what did I get?

150
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,720
Nothing.

151
00:07:20,680 --> 00:07:21,839
But those corrupt officials

152
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,600
used their connections,

153
00:07:24,439 --> 00:07:25,600
took credit for my work,

154
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,879
and used me as a stepping stone.

155
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,680
This world

156
00:07:30,800 --> 00:07:31,959
doesn't reward good people.

157
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,199
It only rewards winners.

158
00:07:35,639 --> 00:07:36,839
So if that's how it is,

159
00:07:37,839 --> 00:07:38,920
I'll be

160
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:40,720
the biggest winner.

161
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,040
I got my start

162
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:45,519
with a drug formula I'd seized.

163
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:47,120
Within a few years,

164
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,759
I controlled

165
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:51,399
Langia's entire underworld.

166
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,439
I used money

167
00:07:54,199 --> 00:07:55,279
to bribe the powerful

168
00:07:55,639 --> 00:07:56,680
and climb to the top.

169
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:58,759
But they

170
00:07:59,519 --> 00:08:00,800
lived off my money

171
00:08:01,399 --> 00:08:03,199
while keeping me in check.

172
00:08:04,240 --> 00:08:04,920
They even

173
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:07,199
tried to take all my money.

174
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:08,920
That's why

175
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,800
I set up

176
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,759
two keys.

177
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:13,319
One

178
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:15,079
was kept at Grand Royal.

179
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:16,480
The other...

180
00:08:17,279 --> 00:08:17,839
is

181
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,480
my fingerprint.

182
00:08:21,959 --> 00:08:22,560
But

183
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:23,839
no one knows

184
00:08:24,480 --> 00:08:26,519
who the real Mian is.

185
00:08:27,759 --> 00:08:29,079
You really schemed all this out.

186
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,720
When you're dealing with wolves,

187
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,799
you have to be

188
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:34,879
more cunning

189
00:08:35,519 --> 00:08:36,399
and more devious than they are.

190
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:38,759
Isn't that

191
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,519
how you made it this far too?

192
00:08:41,759 --> 00:08:42,600
I stepped into the dark

193
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:45,039
to bring people like you down

194
00:08:45,879 --> 00:08:47,600
and let the light
shine where it belongs.

195
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,159
You and I

196
00:08:50,120 --> 00:08:51,279
were never meant to be on the same side.

197
00:08:52,399 --> 00:08:53,279
So...

198
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,559
no more talking.

199
00:08:57,720 --> 00:08:58,360
Dad.

200
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,000
Stop this.

201
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:04,720
I don't want you
doing these terrible things anymore.

202
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,080
Mona.

203
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:11,240
You're more like your mother every day.

204
00:09:13,039 --> 00:09:14,000
You're just as stubborn

205
00:09:14,559 --> 00:09:16,480
as she was,

206
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,919
even if it ruins your whole life.

207
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:20,759
Today,

208
00:09:21,759 --> 00:09:22,279
Dad

209
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,519
will teach you one last lesson.

210
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:28,440
In this world, winners are kings
and losers are outlaws.

211
00:09:29,559 --> 00:09:30,159
Hesitation

212
00:09:30,879 --> 00:09:31,519
and mercy

213
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:34,080
will get you killed.

214
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:36,440
Come on.

215
00:09:37,759 --> 00:09:38,759
Shoot.

216
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,320
Let's see who shoots faster.

217
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:44,519
One!

218
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,159
Two!

219
00:09:51,039 --> 00:09:51,360
Three!

220
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,360
That's...

221
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,120
my daughter.

222
00:10:48,159 --> 00:10:48,840
(Langia police have dismantled a major)

223
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:51,039
(criminal syndicate led by Old Mian.)

224
00:10:51,039 --> 00:10:55,159
(All suspects are in custody.)

225
00:10:55,633 --> 00:10:58,840
(Seized illegal assets
will be lawfully forfeited and)

226
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,919
(fully redirected to local charities
and public.)

227
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:03,879
Daya.

228
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,559
Grand Royal's been shut down for good.

229
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:08,840
Brothers.

230
00:11:10,039 --> 00:11:11,360
A new day has finally come to Langia.

231
00:11:15,919 --> 00:11:16,519
But this time,

232
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:18,600
I really have to go.

233
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:31,440
If you ever get into the jade business,

234
00:11:33,399 --> 00:11:34,399
you know where to find me.

235
00:11:35,519 --> 00:11:35,840
Definitely.

236
00:11:38,919 --> 00:11:39,360
Zhou Yan.

237
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,159
Will we see each other again?

238
00:11:42,799 --> 00:11:44,159
I promised Sihan I'd take her home.

239
00:11:46,399 --> 00:11:47,639
Maybe one day I'll come back.

240
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:53,679
Then I'll wait for you.

241
00:11:53,696 --> 00:11:58,823
♪We clink our bottles,
laughing at our wild youth♪

242
00:12:02,739 --> 00:12:03,039
Hey!

243
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:03,960
Boss!

244
00:12:05,799 --> 00:12:06,600
I'm not dead yet!

245
00:12:06,960 --> 00:12:08,320
Why'd you put my picture on the wall?

246
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:09,120
Ma Ding!

247
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:10,159
You're alive!

248
00:12:15,010 --> 00:12:21,030
♪Why'd you leave me halfway?♪

249
00:12:22,216 --> 00:12:24,216
♪We ran wild, we lived loud♪

250
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,440
Do you know how worried I was?

251
00:12:26,639 --> 00:12:27,240
You're my boss.

252
00:12:27,679 --> 00:12:28,600
You told me to come back alive.

253
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:29,919
I wouldn't dare disobey.

254
00:12:29,956 --> 00:12:33,416
♪Here's a toast to the past,
to the brotherhood we shared♪

255
00:12:33,443 --> 00:12:36,163
♪When I look back,
I'm alone, gazing at the moon♪

256
00:12:42,679 --> 00:12:43,960
What's with that beat-up cane?

257
00:12:44,559 --> 00:12:45,200
As long as I'm alive,

258
00:12:45,679 --> 00:12:46,279
it's just a scratch.

259
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:47,919
Hold on.

260
00:12:55,879 --> 00:12:56,200
Here.

261
00:12:57,519 --> 00:12:58,039
Use this as a cane.

262
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:03,480
Boss.

263
00:13:07,519 --> 00:13:08,279
Boss, don't worry.

264
00:13:09,720 --> 00:13:10,519
Until you come back,

265
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,639
I'll keep the peace around here.

266
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:15,120
But if you're away too long,

267
00:13:15,519 --> 00:13:16,879
I can't guarantee someone won't
try to take your place.

268
00:13:19,476 --> 00:13:24,476
♪All those promises,
we never got the chance to keep♪

269
00:13:25,279 --> 00:13:26,720
If that day ever comes, I'll come back

270
00:13:27,759 --> 00:13:29,480
and deal with anyone
who gets out of line myself.

271
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:36,799
I'm off.

272
00:13:37,850 --> 00:13:41,536
♪The sweet, the fears,
You were the shoulder, always there♪

273
00:13:41,576 --> 00:13:45,023
♪This road is far too long,
without you walking by my side♪

274
00:13:45,056 --> 00:13:46,748
♪The wind slips by, carrying your voice♪

275
00:13:46,773 --> 00:13:53,736
♪Whispering, I hope you've been well♪

276
00:13:54,056 --> 00:13:55,815
♪This road of life♪

277
00:13:55,850 --> 00:14:01,123
♪I'll walk for you♪

278
00:14:01,147 --> 00:14:02,938
♪Every light we ever saw♪

279
00:14:02,963 --> 00:14:08,276
♪I'll keep it in my heart for you♪

280
00:14:08,300 --> 00:14:10,144
♪If there's another life in store♪

281
00:14:10,156 --> 00:14:16,320
♪Let's be brothers just once more♪

282
00:14:16,330 --> 00:14:17,298
♪We'll drink till we're drunk again♪

283
00:14:17,310 --> 00:14:21,456
♪And talk of all the joy and pain♪

284
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,445
♪Dust rises along the border♪

285
00:14:33,470 --> 00:14:34,790
♪Out here, life and death are routine♪

286
00:14:34,790 --> 00:14:36,150
♪Spent shells fall, last echoes ring♪

287
00:14:36,150 --> 00:14:37,550
♪Brothers yesterday, foes today♪

288
00:14:37,550 --> 00:14:38,910
♪Fate's blade falls, who can stop it?♪

289
00:14:38,910 --> 00:14:40,230
♪Against the tide, I never bow♪

290
00:14:40,230 --> 00:14:41,550
♪The night is long, the road unclear♪

291
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:43,230
♪My life is mine to bear♪

292
00:14:43,376 --> 00:14:45,736
♪In chaos, a bloodied titan rages♪

293
